            S1_H["STEP 1 - TRAFFIC + LEAD CAPTURE"]:::stepHeader
            OP1["LEAD COMES IN from one of 7 sources:<br>Risk Report | Estimate Calculator | Chatbot | Canvassing<br>Referral | High-Intent Digital (Google/Direct Site) | Other<br>DAYS 1-14 - CALL CENTER + LEAD PERFECTION OWN THE LEAD:<br>Lead Perfection is the primary CRM and system of record.<br>The call center works the lead through LP with daily call attempts.<br>GHL automated sequences (emails + SMS) run IN PARALLEL alongside those calls.<br>GHL is not replacing the call center - it is warming leads between calls.<br>A lead who just read an email about hurricane damage responds differently on the next call.<br>SPEED-TO-LEAD RULE (v2.1 FINAL - THE SINGLE MOST IMPORTANT OPERATIONAL RULE):<br>The moment of highest intent is IMMEDIATELY after they reach out.<br>Wait too long and no email sequence in the world will recover it.<br>TIER A + B leads (Self Generated, Customer Referral, Canvass, Google, etc):<br>  CALL WITHIN 5 MINUTES. Not 30. Not 2 hours. FIVE MINUTES.<br>  If you miss them: SMS fires automatically within 60 seconds.<br>  These leads close at 15-89%. Speed is the multiplier.<br>TIER C leads (Lead Gurus, MyHomePros, Clever, Modernize):<br>  Call within 30 minutes. Education sequence starts in parallel.<br>TIER D leads (Contractor Appt, Porch101, Chat):<br>  Automated SMS welcome in 5 minutes. Call within 2 hours.<br>  Full education sequence fires immediately.<br>MEASUREMENT: Track how fast you make first contact by source tier.<br>If Tier A/B average exceeds 10 minutes, that is the problem to fix FIRST.<br>IF LEAD IS ON FIRE (score spikes fast): Rep gets IMMEDIATE alert - call them NOW<br>DAY 15+ - GHL TAKES OVER:<br>If no appointment set after 14 days, LP hands off to GHL automatically.<br>The Day 15+ database holds 37,720 unique prospects with zero structured follow-up.<br>At $24,409 avg job value, even 2% reactivation = approximately $18-28M.<br>Zero additional ad spend. These prospects already expressed interest."]
    end

